{
  "name": "resp",
  "description": "A Python-based scholarly search orchestration library designed to aggregate research papers from disparate academic repositories including ArXiv, ACM, Semantic Scholar, and Google Scholar. It implements a unified interface for keyword-based retrieval, citation tree expansion via SerpAPI, and similarity-based graph construction using Selenium-driven automation. The system facilitates automated bibliometric data collection and metadata extraction for large-scale academic literature reviews.",
